{
  "url": "https://www.fcci.life/growth-track",
  "path": "/growth-track",
  "slug": "growth-track",
  "title": "Faith Christian Center International - Growth Track",
  "description": "Church in Charlottesville, Virginia",
  "segments": [
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "text": "Growth Track guides you to discover your redemptive purpose and live the life God created for you. The Growth Track series is made up of four steps that equip you to know God, find freedom, discover your purpose, and make a difference."
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "text": "Step One"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Step One is a basic introduction to the ministry of Faith Christian Center International, it's beliefs, values and vision which will clearly explain who we are and what we believe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "text": "Step Two"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Step Two outlines four essential habits that every believer needs to become a fully devoted follower of Christ. Natural growth is automatic, however spiritual growth must be intentional."
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "text": "Step Three"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Step Three helps you discover your personality, spiritual gifts and purpose in life. With this information, you can see how God combines them for the best fit in ministry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "text": "Step Four"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Step Four is an introduction and orientation for serving in the area of your choice on the Dream Team. Find out ways that you can utilize your gifts to serve God and people in an excellent manner."
    }
  ],
